===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The most [[recent]] thing, particularly [[information]] or [[news]].
#: {{ux|en|Have you heard the '''latest'''?}}
#: {{ux|en|What's the '''latest''' on the demonstrations in New York?}}
#: {{ux|en|Have you met Jane's '''latest'''? I hear he's a hunk.}}
