#* {{quote-book|en|title=Puritan Boston and Quaker Philadelphia|page=54|url=https://books.google.com/books?isbn=156000830X|author=w:Edward Digby Baltzell|year=1979|passage=It has often been said that Philadelphia is the city of firsts, Boston of bests, and New York of '''latests'''.}}

